      "availability": "average",
      "weight": 0.5,
      "description": "<div class='bc-entry'><p class='bc-lead'>A simple breathing mask that covers the nose and mouth or entire face, these offer much better protection than filtration plugs.</p><div class='bc-rule'><p>A character wearing a respirator gains a +30 bonus to Toughness Tests made to resist the effects of gas and may re-roll failed results. Good Craftsmanship models add another +10 bonus, while poor models must be replaced after 10 hours usage as the filter becomes clogged and unusable.</p></div></div>",
      "source": "Only War, p. 198 (Table 6-20), p. 198"
    },
