      "availability": "scarce",
      "weight": 8,
      "description": "<div class='bc-entry'><p class='bc-lead'>Void suits are clumsy affairs designed to protect a user against vacuum.</p><div class='bc-rule'><p>A Common Craftsmanship void suit has 12 hours of air and imposes a –10 penalty to Agility Tests. Poor Craftsmanship versions have six hours of air, while Good and Best Craftsmanship versions eliminate the Agility penalty.</p></div></div>",
